% THE 52% RECOVERABLE-FAILURE FINDING, verbatim: "in as many as 52% of
% quantized-model failures, models reach the right answer in intermediate
% reasoning steps but do not output it as a final answer." This is H2's
% antecedent. Mechanism they give: over-sampling of overthinking markers
% ("wait", "but", "alternatively") at high-entropy positions; a logit penalty
% cuts CoT length 12-23%.
@article{lotfi2026longer,
  title        = {Quantized Reasoning Models Think They Need to Think Longer,
                  but They Do Not},
  author       = {Lotfi, Sanae and Kirichenko, Polina and Li, Steven and
